{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Little Galaxy 是一款專為 1 至 5 歲幼兒設計的互動感官應用，將裝置化成一片可以觸摸的宇宙。孩子每次點按、觸碰或敲擊，畫面都會即時綻放色彩鮮明的行星、流星與各種宇宙奇觀，並配合優美的天體旋律。軟件原價 US $0.99，目前於 App Store 限時免費，適合正首次接觸螢幕的小朋友。</p>\n\n<h2>六大宇宙場景任探索</h2>\n<p>六個主題世界任由探索：行星與彩虹滿佈的宇宙遊樂場、恐龍漫遊的星雲、土星環上的金色夢境、火箭劃過的星艦沙丘、散發電光的電能宇宙，以及最純粹的深空星海。每次點按都會奏出配合該世界氛圍的獨特音符，沒有關卡、計時與規則，亦無廣告、不收集資料與內購。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-160-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-161-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-162-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-163-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-164-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Little Galaxy</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:05.532238+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T18:35:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:24.275726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:24.275726+00:00","content_hash":"c3334762a472cbabc8073bbbe63ca8976f6559513370ce7b6c73aee31d5ada1c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}